        <p>
          In Palworld, individual monster stats are influenced by hidden Talents (Individual Values or IVs) that add between 0% and +30% bonus to HP, Attack, and Defense.
        </p>
        <p>
          Based on datamined community research, each stat has an independent inheritance distribution:
        </p>
